## REPOSITORY PHILOSOPHY

This is an AI-native, context-engineered, governance-driven software system.

Goals:
- minimize AI context overload
- isolate feature domains
- prevent hallucinated modifications
- enforce deterministic workflows
- support safe multi-agent AI development

