## CONTEXT LOADING RULES

### FORBIDDEN

NEVER:
- scan entire repository
- load unnecessary files
- perform broad context analysis
- guess undocumented architecture
- modify unrelated modules
- bypass feature boundaries

### LOADING ORDER

Follow `.agents/AGENTS.md` NẠP workflow → `.ai/CONTEXT_MANIFEST.md` routes to all required files.

